E|Round 2 fixed both colour findings. Built and ran the suite in the worktree: 0 warnings, 0 errors, 138/138
E|Colour survives redirection again: piping yields 2 escape sequences where round 1 yielded 0
E|-no-color yields exactly 0 escapes, and NO_COLOR=1 yields exactly 0
E|Per-segment palette restored: five distinct colours in one frame - cyan badge, blue repository, orange Claude, purple Codex, green healthy marker
